# Preface

These notes were written on the quay.


# The Ferry


<!-- page: 1 -->

The ferry leaves at seven. Café tables fill early, and the señor at the counter pours coffee without asking.1


## Morning Tides


Gulls argue over crusts; everyone says “good morning” in three languages.


- Bread from the bakery
- Smoked fish


## Tip

Arrive early for a window seat.


